{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "version": "c126da285247544ac9a74242f87df01f262dc4ed38e67602fe08f2d5cec03349",
  "duration": 153.6,
  "synthetic": true,
  "voiceSha256": "5d492a6250c4e930263b93e82be7b8fc824fad1be3fdcd0ff74a9d37f3cfdad6",
  "captionsSha256": "e12f354de62072c1d4848803b3600e55a2e37ff71919caf4df8df89c0b085ea4",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "r01",
      "text": "把这只猫翻过来，它还是猫。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 0.25,
      "end": 2.89,
      "duration": 2.64,
      "key": "9aee1c7962871443ae056baf5e716b2bd6c1cc1d275abcd547bc44a847314575"
    },
    {
      "id": "r02",
      "text": "可对机器，为什么曾经这么难？",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 3.1,
      "end": 5.884,
      "duration": 2.784,
      "key": "b8c06ee93798c15a1ab65f9f1c6b5217353033e82c736f81ce0d9c957dc5b353"
    },
    {
      "id": "r03",
      "text": "七十年的变化，藏在三道问题里。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 6.2,
      "end": 9.176,
      "duration": 2.976,
      "key": "47aa07bdb9ad06718ffdd33bd1b32bacfb0768d24c27861df230457840b823b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "r04",
      "text": "第一题：能不能把知识，写成规则？",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 9.6,
      "end": 13.104,
      "duration": 3.504,
      "key": "ff43213d643c57f895cafb5433f98a76ad83ae7530dd605941ec3810abc5bc0c"
    },
    {
      "id": "r05",
      "text": "一九五六年，达特茅斯让人工智能成为研究领域。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 13.3,
      "end": 17.668,
      "duration": 4.368,
      "key": "bd2ce199624e6349072344f7e7e95b34f398c55a2d66edf921d8cb6e67ec08d3"
    },
    {
      "id": "r06",
      "text": "尖耳朵，加胡须，就判断是猫。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 18.3,
      "end": 21.516000000000002,
      "duration": 3.216,
      "key": "3ecd2648387452bd974e1cd7c985ff028874074d1a0aa312c5c8844bd3d0c61c"
    },
    {
      "id": "r07",
      "text": "遮住耳朵，规则就失效。现实总有例外。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 22.5,
      "end": 26.556,
      "duration": 4.056,
      "key": "bf1d7fdc34c010e3a26b2af88fc4bd9238d81b7b0251480b49b9d5927bd9419c"
    },
    {
      "id": "r08",
      "text": "那就换题：别手写答案，让机器从样本里学。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 27.1,
      "end": 31.060000000000002,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "key": "e5698d1b064c70a3091c424ae221b6c4639d270002a743eab4d80c773d23643e"
    },
    {
      "id": "r09",
      "text": "先猜，算误差，再调整连接的权重。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 31.4,
      "end": 35,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "key": "eb64e27fe791ce177e344a8a2cfa1209602e26f5c39e404997d745f52bd27d66"
    },
    {
      "id": "r10",
      "text": "反向传播，负责高效计算该往哪儿调整。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 35.5,
      "end": 39.076,
      "duration": 3.576,
      "key": "011eda08a9e99a4ebf42818bdaaa73c8e0a32c48074b3775efde12e4e7f75286"
    },
    {
      "id": "r11",
      "text": "反复练习，错误才有机会减少。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 40,
      "end": 43.048,
      "duration": 3.048,
      "key": "3ea75cd500643ef2c0f215214832b4f09c9e88fdac2f991e4e916535b345c1f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "r12",
      "text": "记住训练题，不等于学会。得考没见过的题。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 43.5,
      "end": 47.556,
      "duration": 4.056,
      "key": "77896d612a51aab6eec1a7240c7934b29b094bd185ddf675f9f201e7a4b650c1"
    },
    {
      "id": "r13",
      "text": "接着，把简单特征，一层层组合。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 48,
      "end": 51.432,
      "duration": 3.432,
      "key": "b4405383622eaeb2448642b96996a3d9d12b19a46b67c9ae59e3fd8d98bcd817"
    },
    {
      "id": "r14",
      "text": "从边缘，到局部，再到更复杂的模式。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 51.7,
      "end": 55.18,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "key": "0e8cb92a031c9c974282e46d9035d94940cf76e6aeac89e9a78ea45faa3a8503"
    },
    {
      "id": "r15",
      "text": "二零一二年，深度网络突破了图像识别。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 55.5,
      "end": 59.172,
      "duration": 3.672,
      "key": "423d854e3e05ff2346eebeb4150a276d20438280c4dbe348bf981de376878ea5"
    },
    {
      "id": "r16",
      "text": "数据提供例子，图形处理器负责并行计算。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 60,
      "end": 63.768,
      "duration": 3.768,
      "key": "8b37b2c39e783e0c51c412ca63b2168bc15098475f5b87451409ef054e12d1b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "r17",
      "text": "机器，也开始学习怎么选择。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 64.1,
      "end": 66.74,
      "duration": 2.64,
      "key": "57152b86e08b8b582a8995882d1a57da09f8f6b9b962f9547f0f6576c5552f4b"
    },
    {
      "id": "r18",
      "text": "阿尔法狗用网络筛选落点、评估局面，再配合搜索。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 67.2,
      "end": 71.592,
      "duration": 4.392,
      "key": "1743e4d8b36bb459894541a6a727dc60e20fb5476783d9a49a18c50563ea248c"
    },
    {
      "id": "r19",
      "text": "二零一六年，它以四比一战胜李世石。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 72.5,
      "end": 75.716,
      "duration": 3.216,
      "key": "4d332e5e96fae3d67e671be54562f67d19edf0292d39c7a3bc9ccbd048c3e90b"
    },
    {
      "id": "r20",
      "text": "识别和决策有了，怎样处理整句话？",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 77,
      "end": 80.144,
      "duration": 3.144,
      "key": "613c0a33eb5aeb414d75807dcd7c66be5f0a4251d5049b4eaf06e72b152c8d66"
    },
    {
      "id": "r21",
      "text": "二零一七年，变换器架构给出一条新路。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 82,
      "end": 85.288,
      "duration": 3.288,
      "key": "beba2a81faa7fa3b3ded5c70d477706f99e5f6eef17614308388127aeed65ebe"
    },
    {
      "id": "r22",
      "text": "小猫追球，它想玩。它指的是谁？",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 86.2,
      "end": 89.8,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "key": "ae0d0f3848856a69567bbdc2ceaca70320daae3a4368d2f34b6988bbf4a38c7d"
    },
    {
      "id": "r23",
      "text": "注意力，把相关位置的信息，按权重组合。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 90.4,
      "end": 94.096,
      "duration": 3.696,
      "key": "86d9c1ec9eaa06c95cbd9942ffd57fa2864e3505a6ca3ac0091d3cd19dab5786"
    },
    {
      "id": "r24",
      "text": "背后，是向量之间的批量计算。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 95,
      "end": 97.928,
      "duration": 2.928,
      "key": "59f08722902a505be8d8e7234f8e41160ae5aedc947764137b4b9e86aca61c6b"
    },
    {
      "id": "r25",
      "text": "第三题：预测下个词元，能学到什么？",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 99,
      "end": 102.48,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "key": "dc5cb49d99281633b8355a17aaa40d50faaa0a40ee3320178742126a624b3141"
    },
    {
      "id": "r26",
      "text": "太阳从，更可能接东方，而不是海底。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 103.2,
      "end": 106.70400000000001,
      "duration": 3.504,
      "key": "1686dfdea867a5922270f7d1c03dd06ff96705308f08f5c28395b62a88142953"
    },
    {
      "id": "r27",
      "text": "海量文本训练，让网络积累语言和知识模式。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 107.4,
      "end": 111.31200000000001,
      "duration": 3.912,
      "key": "cc8d256bf2e15830f54a2cc1597277433f0385d2b4fbdea41bc1eb2c4fa95311"
    },
    {
      "id": "r28",
      "text": "再用指令示范和反馈训练，让它更适合回答人。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 112,
      "end": 115.864,
      "duration": 3.864,
      "key": "7f45d41d8dc26b68ea017ec4095d4549fdf1222faa2abe4dc695f1d645c6c1ee"
    },
    {
      "id": "r29",
      "text": "二零二二年，聊天机器人引发大众关注。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 117,
      "end": 120.624,
      "duration": 3.624,
      "key": "c83dab83bbcb8cdd767f1f22d43665fe96c23c70e7aa6c8a17f98fd6fd223ae1"
    },
    {
      "id": "r30",
      "text": "文字、图像、声音接起来，就有了多模态交互。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 121,
      "end": 125.2,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "key": "33a0c7d38a62e05f6b7a59873c65b7c6c682e98da99f769803d1bc562b8c99f8"
    },
    {
      "id": "r31",
      "text": "但会说，不等于说对。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 126,
      "end": 128.304,
      "duration": 2.304,
      "key": "a36d2a22d91f05e65efc021aa01a8c25c07c0b5d670e76c1a4d6756ecc1bebd4"
    },
    {
      "id": "r32",
      "text": "它也会自信地，编出不存在的依据。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 129,
      "end": 132.048,
      "duration": 3.048,
      "key": "4c20668ecae02dda2f38ba983d6a7ec6183b89631025b9a47f63caa773318b47"
    },
    {
      "id": "r33",
      "text": "所以，重要答案要核验，关键决定仍要人负责。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 133,
      "end": 137.368,
      "duration": 4.368,
      "key": "3ce08c5b3e86e6434330acdaae400f6c07eb201a0b937d923963ba929322e5c4"
    },
    {
      "id": "r34",
      "text": "从写规则，到学规律，再到与人协作。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 138,
      "end": 141.768,
      "duration": 3.768,
      "key": "6ea5953176eb77b250838eac0057c27bdcfef42d38aff4ea3f180268521f32e7"
    },
    {
      "id": "r35",
      "text": "人工智能的下一步，不只取决于机器能做什么。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 143,
      "end": 146.912,
      "duration": 3.912,
      "key": "b31c9b12545e4a8551f246de55ae3009b85d9145c370bedd442415bf329d1807"
    },
    {
      "id": "r36",
      "text": "也取决于，我们问什么，验证什么。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 148,
      "end": 151.192,
      "duration": 3.192,
      "key": "3834ff0c3f5d05bca44a45ba2c5f2673f743844e3877674b762b6d8b61f417f0"
    }
  ]
}